# The frontend needs no configuration; it defaults to http://localhost:8000.
#
# The one variable that exists is where it sends requests. Set it inline when you want
# the guardrail pipeline in front of MediBot, or put it in `.env.local` (which Next reads,
# unlike this file) if you would rather it stuck:
#
#     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:9000 pnpm dev
#
# https://github.com/LijiAlex/guardrail-eval-pipeline
